                    <div><p class="dq-tnum"><span class="dq-w"></span>.<span class="dq-t"></span>s</p><span class="dq-tcap">Google PageSpeed, phone test</span></div>
                    <span class="dq-ring dq-r50"><b>50</b></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="dq-ms">
                    <p class="dq-mr dq-m1"><i></i><span>First thing on screen</span><b>8.0s</b></p>
