                  <span class="dq-day">Yesterday</span>
                  <div class="dq-msg dq-out dq-rv dq-j0">Hi, is this TV still available?<small><svg class="dq-ic dq-xs" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m2 13 4 4 8-9"></path><path d="m10 16 1 1 8-9"></path></svg></small></div>
                  <span class="dq-seen dq-rv dq-j1">Seen</span>
