                </div>
                <div class="dq-cbar"><span>Message</span><svg class="dq-ic dq-s" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"></rect><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v3"></path></svg></div>
                <span class="dq-tag dq-hi">Sample conversation</span>
              </div>
              <div class="dq-gw">
                <div class="dq-lay dq-good dq-chat">
                  <div class="dq-chead"><svg class="dq-ic dq-back" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m15 6-6 6 6 6"></path></svg><span class="dq-av"><svg class="dq-ic dq-s" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 10h16l-1.5-5h-13z"></path><path d="M5 10v9h14v-9"></path><path d="M10 19v-5h4v5"></path></svg></span><div><b>Your business</b><span class="on">online</span></div></div>
                  <div class="dq-thread">
                    <span class="dq-day">Yesterday</span>
                    <div class="dq-msg dq-out">Hi, is this TV still available?<small><svg class="dq-ic dq-xs" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m2 13 4 4 8-9"></path><path d="m10 16 1 1 8-9"></path></svg></small></div>
                    <div class="dq-msg dq-in">Yes, it's in stock. Delivered, or will you pick it up?<small>Automatic reply</small></div>
                    <div class="dq-msg dq-out">Delivered, tomorrow if possible.<small><svg class="dq-ic dq-xs" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m2 13 4 4 8-9"></path><path d="m10 16 1 1 8-9"></path></svg></small></div>
                    <div class="dq-msg dq-in">Done. What name for the order?<small>Automatic reply</small></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="dq-cbar"><span>Message</span><svg class="dq-ic dq-s" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"></rect><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v3"></path></svg></div>
                  <span class="dq-tag dq-hi">Sample conversation</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="dq-wipe"><span><svg class="dq-ic dq-s" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12.5 10 17 19 7"></path></svg></span></span>
            </div>

            <div class="dq-scr dq-s3 dq-seq dq-k3" data-dstep="3">
              <div class="dq-lay dq-bad">
